      "content": "Hey, I'm working on a backgrounder regarding the recent Supreme Court ruling on Chevron deference. Can you give me a quick breakdown of the main arguments for and against it? I also need to know if the concerns raised by the dissenters regarding administrative overreach actually hold water or if they're just being used as a political talking point.",
